{"id":"perisophia","name":"Perisophia","type":"character","aliases":["Head Speaker Perisophia","Honored Speaker Perisophia","Master Perisophia","Perisophia the philosopher"],"description":"A centaur philosopher and teacher on Theros, leader of the Elpidian school and senior Speaker of The Twelve of Meletis, Chosen of Ephara.","pages":16,"first_seen":"2014-01-15","last_seen":"2024-09-27","description_citations":[{"source":"mtg-wiki","official":false,"publisher":"MTG Wiki contributors","work":"Perisophia","series":"MTG Wiki","authors":[],"date":"","url":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Perisophia","link":"https://mtg.wiki/page/Perisophia","archived":null,"license":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","text":"\"Perisophia\". MTG Wiki contributors, CC BY-NC-SA 4.0."}],"bio":null,"timeline":[{"id":"nature-identity-2014-01-15-e0","era":null,"summary":"Perisophia opens a lesson in Meletis by asking her students what identity is, using the example of a leonin cub raised by wolves.","participants":["perisophia","kyrios","samia","rhytho"],"location":"meletis","importance":"minor","page":"stories/nature-identity-2014-01-15","order":425,"story_date":"2014-01-15","storyline":"Theros","source":"wizards","paragraph":13,"quote":"\"What is identity? What makes us who we are?\"","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=%22What%20is%20identity%3F%20What,us%20who%20we%20are%3F%22","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Nature of Identity","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Wizards of the Coast"],"date":"2014-01-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/nature-identity-2014-01-15#:~:text=%22What%20is%20identity%3F%20What,us%20who%20we%20are%3F%22","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Nature of Identity\" by Wizards of the Coast. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Jan 2014."}},{"id":"nature-identity-2014-01-1